l.aspx"},{"c":"WWD 2018 Q4","e":"wwd","d":"2018-11-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Weber","x":"…of times, it's very difficult to quantify all the downstream impacts of what will you be able to pass through, what supply tariffs will be impacted and all the productivity that will go along with that, but we estimate that it is less than $10 million total impact that would probably be…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/07/woodward-inc-wwd-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"WWD 2019 Q1","e":"wwd","d":"2019-01-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Gendron","x":"While uncertainty in the broader economic landscape exists due to the current tariff, ongoing international trade negotiations as well as government shutdowns, our view as we look to the remainder of fiscal year 2019 remains optimistic about our markets, performance and outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/28/woodward-inc-wwd-q1-2019-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"WWD 2019 Q1","e":"wwd","d":"2019-01-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Gendron","x":"…have an opportunity on the upside, but we're also very cautious about these trade issues, tariff issues, oil and gas prices, there's a number of elements here that could impact our Industrial side, but we're off to a good start and we feel that the past work we did on restructuring the…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/28/woodward-inc-wwd-q1-2019-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"WWD 2019 Q1","e":"wwd","d":"2019-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Gendron","x":"…impact our Industrial side, but we're off to a good start and we feel that the past work we did on restructuring the Industrial business, the addition of L-Orange, the -- how well the integration is going that, there could be opportunity, but we have to get to these market uncertainties first.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/28/woodward-inc-wwd-q1-2019-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"WWD 2019 Q1","e":"wwd","d":"2019-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher Glynn","x":"So I had a question about the Industrial margin there, obviously very strong first quarter above your full year guide, and maybe some more restructuring benefits from your initiatives might flow through during the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/28/woodward-inc-wwd-q1-2019-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"WWD 2019 Q2","e":"wwd","d":"2019-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Gendron","x":"As a result, we are increasing our outlook for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/29/woodward-inc-wwd-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"WWD 2019 Q2","e":"wwd","d":"2019-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robert F. Weber Jr.","x":"As a result, we are raising our guidance for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/29/woodward-inc-wwd-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"WWD 2019 Q3","e":"wwd","d":"2019-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert F. Weber","x":"Obviously, we continue to try to streamline the non-segment area.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/woodward-inc-wwd-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"WWD 2019 Q4","e":"wwd","d":"2019-11-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Gendron","x":"The trade war is so uncertain in our minds, but the China-6 sales are growing nicely right now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/18/woodward-inc-wwd-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"WWD 2020 Q1","e":"wwd","d":"2020-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Gendron","x":"We are streamlining our power generation business with today's announced divestiture of our renewable power systems and protective relay businesses to the Aureliu